    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. Racing stripes carry no numbers or sponsor marks.. Panel gaps, glazing, lamp lenses, wheel arches and the underside floorpan are all modelled, and the top and bottom views confirm a closed body with no missing faces. No brand badge, wordmark or number plate appears anywhere.",
